    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is pleased to present No. 45 Wainsfort Road, an impressive five-bedroom semi-detached residence located on one of the most desirable residential roads in Dublin 6W.\n\nNo. 45 offers a discerning purchaser a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial family home that has been carefully maintained and thoughtfully extended over the years by its current owners. The property is further enhanced by a beautifully private rear garden and provides excellent scope for further extension or reconfiguration, subject to the necessary planning permission.\n\nThe well-appointed accommodation comprises an entrance porch leading into a welcoming hallway, a living room with sliding doors opening into the sitting room, and a spacious kitchen/dining area. An enclosed side passage provides access to the garage, and a guest WC completes the ground-floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, the property comprises five well-proportioned bedrooms, a family bathroom and a separate WC.\n\nNo description of this warm and inviting home would be complete without reference to its superb gardens. To the front, a driveway provides off-street parking and is complemented by a neatly maintained lawn, mature hedging and established shrubbery. To the rear, the property boasts a generous, west-facing garden enjoying a high degree of privacy. Predominantly laid in lawn, it features a patio area and is richly planted with mature fruit trees, shrubs and well-stocked beds, creating an ideal setting for both relaxation and outdoor entertaining.\n\nThe location alone speaks volumes about this superbly appointed residence. Surrounded by a wealth of amenities to include well-established local junior and senior schools such as Terenure and Templeogue Colleges, Our Lady's and St Pius X Junior School. Terenure College and St Mary's rugby clubs are also close by as is Templeogue Tennis Club. The extensive recreational amenities and sporting facilities of Bushy Park are literally just around the corner. The area is also well serviced by transport links to include bus routes and the M50. All your shopping needs will be catered for with excellent local facilities at Terenure, Templeogue, Sundrive and Rathfarnham.\n\nEarly viewing comes highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 2.32m x 0.61m\nSliding doors and wood flooring.\n\nHall - 2.32m x 5.11m\nWooden door, carpet floor and ceiling coving.\n\nLiving Room - 3.65m x 4.27m\nCarpet flooring, ceiling coving, open fire and sliding door leading to:\n\nSitting Room - 3.65m x 4.27m\nCarpet flooring, ceiling coving, open fire and sliding doors leading to the rear garden.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.21m x 3.04m\nLinoleum floor, stainless steel sink, built-in kitchen units, Bosch washing machine, Gas hob, Cooke & Lewis extractor fan, Neff oven, Tricity Bendix dishwasher and Beko fridge freezer.\n\nWC - 0.78m x 2.14m\nTiled flooring, WC, wash hand basin and alarm control panel.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.65m x 4.27m\nDouble room looking over the front garden with carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.65m x 4.27m\nDouble room looking over the rear garden with carpet flooring.\n\nWC - 0.82m x 1.88m\nLinoleum floor, tiled walls and WC.\n\nBathroom - 1.52m x 1.88m\nTiled floor and walls, wash hand basin, bathtub with Mira Vigour electric shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.76m x 4.27m\nDouble room looking over the rear garden with carpet flooring and a shower cubicle with electric shower Triton A52000XT.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.76m x 4.27m\nDouble room looking over the front garden with carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 5 - 2.32m x 2.97m\nSingle room looking over the front garden with carpet floor and built-in wardrobe.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>5-bedroomed semi-detached home</li><li>Superbly located on this sought-after road</li><li>Close to a host of local amenities, schools and sports clubs</li><li>Off-street parking</li><li>Garage</li><li>Large and private south-facing rear garden</li><li>Potential to further extend (subject to PP)</ul>"
      },
